audible-mcp
===========

This repository is a Go reimplementation of the audible-mcp MCP server
originally published at https://github.com/tannerwj/audible-mcp
under the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 tannerwj.

The original TypeScript tree is not shipped here. Tool names, CLI
commands, the audible-auth.json schema, and the read-only Audible API
surface were preserved so existing auth bundles and MCP client configs
keep working.

Authentication
--------------

Device login and request signing implement Amazon's Audible iOS app
protocol (OpenID Authorization Code + PKCE, then RSA-SHA256 ADP
signatures). Device type A2CZJZGLK2JJVM and related iOS app identifiers
are Amazon's public protocol constants, not original creative work.

This package is not a port of mkb79/Audible or mkb79/audible-cli, which
are licensed AGPL-3.0. Those projects documented the unofficial Audible
API; mkb79/audible-rs is a separate MIT-licensed reimplementation by the
same author and was used only as protocol prior art.

